{
  "bookId": "hero-212108",
  "id": "bond-28568",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28568001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "交代给你的事情做得如何了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我刚做好，给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "不错，大致还算满足了我的要求。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "在修改了301遍设计稿之后，你果然没有让我失望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你满意就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "这栩栩如生的莲花池，以后就能和姐姐在里面共浴了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "还有我要的「西湖十景」，嗯，姐姐看了一定会喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么姐姐长姐姐短的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "因为姐姐最重要，姐姐开心，我才能开心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "如此繁琐的一件事，你却能不厌其烦地完成，很让我刮目相看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "过奖，以后别老欺负我就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "哼，我姐姐一看到你，就不愿多陪我了，被我欺负一下是你的本分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28568013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小青",
          "text": "不过我答应你，以后不再无理取闹就是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
